## Input

```css
@media ($feature + "" >= 40rem) { .inside {} }
@media (40rem <= $feature + "") { .inside {} }
@media (20rem < $feature + "" <= 80rem) { .inside {} }
@media (range-name() >= 40rem) { .inside {} }
@media (40rem <= range-name()) { .inside {} }
@media (20rem < range-name() <= 80rem) { .inside {} }
@media (range-name(): 40rem) { .inside {} }
@media ("min" + "-width": 40rem) { .inside {} }
@import "wide-layout.css" screen and ($feature + "" >= 40rem);
@media (#{$feature} + "" >= 40rem) { .inside {} }
@media ("#{$feature}" >= 40rem) { .inside {} }
.following { color: green; }

```


